WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.650
Wealth, fame, power...

3
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.440
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

5
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.360
attained this and everything else
the world had to offer.

6
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.820
And his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

7
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.660
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

8
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.660
You want my treasure?

9
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.700
You can have it!

10
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.450
Go ahead.

11
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.040
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

12
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.660
Find it!

13
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.250
Everything is right where I left it!

14
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.250
Now you just have to find it!

15
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.750
These words lured
men to the Grand Line

16
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:26.380
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

17
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.920
in pursuit of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine!

18
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.630
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

19
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.850
This is the time known as
the Great Pirate Era!

20
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.640
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

21
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.440
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

22
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.690
One Piece!

23
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

24
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

25
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

26
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

27
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.710
When the world's got you down,

28
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

29
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.190
Their biorhythm will carry you through

30
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
We're gonna make the most of it

31
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.400
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

32
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.990
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

33
00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.040
Got some change to my name,

34
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.250
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

35
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.130
We are, we are on the cruise!

36
00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.760
WE ARE!

37
00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.130
[GENZO] You just never learn, do you?

38
00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:02.940
[NAMI] Let go! I'll pay you
later... any way you want.

39
00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:03.940
Ahh!

40
00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:05.550
[BELLEMERE] You made a boy cry?

41
00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:06.850
[NOJIKO] He made me mad!

42
00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:09.650
[MOTHER] Oh, it's okay.
Kids will be kids.

43
00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:11.570
[NAMI] He said your tangerines suck.

44
00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:12.360
[BELLEMERE] He what?!

45
00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:13.530
[MOTHER] Bellemere!

46
00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:16.450
[BELLEMERE] Never give up...

47
00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:23.290
You must find the strength
inside you to always move on...

48
00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:26.710
You must live through every moment.

49
00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:34.470
[BELLEMERE] And if you can
smile in the face of it all,

50
00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:37.640
that is the greatest strength.

51
00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:43.640
<b>Live</b>

52
00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:43.640
[NAMI, NOJIKO] Bellemere!

53
00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.900
Hahahaha!

54
00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:49.520
While I'm in charge,
those without money will die!

55
00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.150
Now do you understand me, you worms?!

56
00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:55.820
Hahahahaha!

57
00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:57.410
[HATCHAN] What's this?

58
00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:58.410
A map?

59
00:02:58.410 --> 00:02:59.510
[NAMI] No!

60
00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:00.210
That's my map!

61
00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:03.370
I drew it. You can't have it!

62
00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:04.830
A child drew this?

63
00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:05.460
Give it back!

64
00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:06.970
[NOJIKO] Nami, no!

65
00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:08.670
[ARLONG] Hmmm...

66
00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.000
Very good.

67
00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:11.960
[gasps]

68
00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:14.590
[ARLONG] She could be useful.
Bring her with us.

69
00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:15.720
[HATCHAN] Right!

70
00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:20.140
Waaaah! No! Help!

71
00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:22.170
Let her go! Let her go!

72
00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:22.850
[GENZO] Wait!

73
00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:26.480
You promised not to hurt her
if you got your money.

74
00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:29.690
Right, I won't hurt her,
just borrow her for a while.

75
00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:31.440
Genzo, help me.

76
00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:33.480
I won't let you take her.

77
00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.110
Kuroobi.

78
00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:42.780
Genzo! Genzo! Genzo!

79
00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:44.250
Genzo!

80
00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:52.840
I'll... I'll save you, Nami...

81
00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:55.300
I won't let you go.

82
00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:57.590
No, please...! It's okay...!

83
00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.090
You don't need to save me!

84
00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:00.810
Enough of this!

85
00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:02.350
[GENZO] I will... save you.

86
00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:09.400
[NAMI] Please, no more killing!

87
00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:21.870
[DOCTOR] All of our ships
have been sunk...

88
00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:28.000
I'm afraid our plan to have Nami and
Nojiko escape to the sea was... a bad plan.

89
00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:31.500
The Marines won't
bother trying to save us...

90
00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:33.380
We've lost our island.

91
00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:35.880
Bellemere knew that
this would happen...

92
00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:40.720
Her experiences in the Marines taught her
what all these creatures are capable of.

93
00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:44.220
She knew that none of us would escape.

94
00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.890
[NOJIKO sobs]

95
00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:51.500
They've taken Nami...

96
00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:54.850
What am I supposed to do now?

97
00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.320
Bellemere...

98
00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:02.530
[DOCTOR] We know where
Arlong and his crew are!

99
00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:06.040
It looks like they're going to settle
right here on this island...

100
00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:07.750
It's time to decide.

101
00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:09.660
We can fight to the death right now...

102
00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:12.080
or we can take a chance
that the Marines will someday

103
00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:15.520
come to save us and hope and pray
we don't get killed before then...

104
00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:16.750
Your choice!

105
00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:20.840
[GENZO] Only Marine headquarters
stands a chance against them.

106
00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:23.750
But they have their hands
full with the Grand Line...

107
00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:28.100
The chances that they would come all the
way out here for us are as good as zero.

108
00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:31.480
But I can't just sit here
and abandon Nami...

109
00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:32.810
We must fight.

110
00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:36.860
I'm in...

111
00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:40.360
I can't just stand by and do
nothing when a child is in danger.

112
00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:42.440
Now who else will come fight beside us?

113
00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:45.620
I don't care if they kill me,
I'm going to save that little brat.

114
00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:48.410
[VILLAGER 3] Bellemere gave her life
for those girls, we should do no less!

115
00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:49.870
[VILLAGER 4] Let's fight!

116
00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:53.420
[VILLAGER 5] If just one of us fights,
they'll blame us all, so let's do it!

117
00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:02.780
[NOJIKO] Nami! Nami!

118
00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:03.480
[VILLAGER 1] Nami!

119
00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:04.140
[VILLAGER 2] What?!

120
00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:05.340
[VILLAGER 3] You're okay!

121
00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:09.820
[NOJIKO] Nami, Nami...! Are you okay...?

122
00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:11.730
Did they hurt you any?

123
00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:15.270
Hey...

124
00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:18.250
[NAMI] I'm... joining them.

125
00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:21.530
[NOJIKO] Huh?

126
00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:23.740
[NAMI] I'm joining Arlong's crew.

127
00:06:24.790 --> 00:06:26.780
I'll get to be a
navigator and draw maps.

128
00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:26.280
[gasps]

129
00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:30.290
[ALL gasp]

130
00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:34.040
Heh... What in the world
are you talking about?

131
00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:36.540
Stand back...

132
00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:39.130
Did they threaten to do
something terrible to you...?

133
00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:40.840
Please... tell me.

134
00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:41.510
[NAMI] No.

135
00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:42.880
They must have done something!

136
00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:43.810
No!

137
00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:44.710
Tell the truth!

138
00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.340
[NAMI] Let go of me!

139
00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:47.090
Nami.

140
00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:47.890
[gasping]

141
00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:48.800
[NOJIKO] No!

142
00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:55.310
But... that's an... Arlong tattoo.

143
00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:57.650
Not you.

144
00:06:57.670 --> 00:06:58.980
But why?

145
00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:04.490
Look at this... They
gave me all this money.

146
00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:10.450
Heh heh... They say...
they'll buy me anything I want.

147
00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:11.740
[NOJIKO] No...!

148
00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:13.750
I will never forgive you
if you join them!

149
00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:14.870
Don't you understand?!

150
00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:17.580
They killed Bellemere in front of us!

151
00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:19.100
She died to keep us safe.

152
00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.050
I'll never forgive you! Never!

153
00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:22.210
You're not my sister!

154
00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:23.340
Who cares?

155
00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:26.620
Why would I want to live like
Bellemere if it just gets you killed?

156
00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:29.430
I don't wanna die like that!

157
00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:33.430
[NOJIKO] How could you...?

158
00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:37.020
[NOJIKO] Bellemere...

159
00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:41.050
Bellemere gave her life so that you
and I could go on living... together.

160
00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:42.550
[GENZO] That's enough, Nojiko!

161
00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:43.860
Leave us, Nami!

162
00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.700
Never set foot in this village again!

163
00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.330
[NOJIKO] Nami!

164
00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:01.420
[GENZO] I don't understand.

165
00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:03.840
How could she betray
her family like that?

166
00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:05.630
For money?

167
00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:08.090
Bellemere was like her mother.

168
00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:20.860
[NOJIKO] Nami loved Bellemere...

169
00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:23.570
I know she did.

170
00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.490
[NAMI] Hey...

171
00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:38.940
[NAMI] Didn't Bellemere always say...
"Good things will come your way,

172
00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:42.380
as long as you continue to live.

173
00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:44.590
Lots of good things."

174
00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:46.010
[NOJIKO] Yes.

175
00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:53.470
[NAMI] After Arlong took me, I watched him
sink five Marine ships like they were toys.

176
00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:55.890
I don't think they'll send any more.

177
00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:57.810
We're on our own.

178
00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:00.600
So I decided I'd do something about it.

179
00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:04.480
I made a deal with Arlong to
buy Cocoyashi Village from him.

180
00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:06.360
[NOJIKO] Buy Cocoyashi?

181
00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:07.770
How?

182
00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:10.150
[NAMI] For 100 million berries.

183
00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:15.370
If I buy the town, we'll be free.

184
00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:17.910
No one else will die.

185
00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:21.120
And all I have to do is join
his crew and draw maps.

186
00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.390
[NOJIKO] But 100 million berries!

187
00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:25.920
You can't earn that
working your whole life.

188
00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:28.510
[NAMI] I will get
that money no matter what.

189
00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:30.110
People are having a hard enough time

190
00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:34.760
paying their own tribute
so I have to do this alone.

191
00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:37.770
If anyone tries to help me,
they'll just get hurt.

192
00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:45.610
[NOJIKO] Won't it be hard?

193
00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:47.270
[NAMI] Yeah...

194
00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:50.150
[NOJIKO] Living with the
people who killed our mother?

195
00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:51.530
[NAMI] I'll be okay.

196
00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:55.480
I'll just smile
every time I see his face.

197
00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:58.580
I'm not going to cry anymore.

198
00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.620
I'm going to fight by myself.

199
00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:25.400
[NOJIKO] To make a choice like that
when you're only ten years old.

200
00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:28.820
Do you know how hard
that must have been?

201
00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:33.360
All to save the
village she loved so much...

202
00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:34.080
That girl...

203
00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:34.780
Ahhhh!

204
00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:38.080
Whoever makes Nami suffer's
going to hear from me!

205
00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:41.000
Why'd you do that?

206
00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:44.920
Because... I'm telling
you to stay out of it...

207
00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:47.250
If you go around saying
that she's your friend,

208
00:10:47.260 --> 00:10:49.920
they're going to become
suspicious of her.

209
00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:53.380
Then her eight years of suffering
will have been for nothing.

210
00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:55.550
Don't make it harder
than it already is.

211
00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:58.510
She has to fight alone.

212
00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:02.810
Knowing there are people who call
her "friend" only makes the suffering worse.

213
00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:19.620
[PIRATE A] Get back here, you little brat!

214
00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:20.780
[PIRATE B] Stop!

215
00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:24.750
[NOJIKO] A pirate thief?

216
00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:26.120
[NAMI] That's right.

217
00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:29.920
The only thing this place has going for
it is plenty of pirates to steal from.

218
00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:31.880
[NAMI] I'm gonna make 'em pay!

219
00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:33.880
[NOJIKO] You're all cut up!

220
00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:36.380
[NAMI] Yeah, I kinda screwed up.

221
00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:38.180
But look, one million berries.

222
00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:39.350
[NOJIKO] Who cares about that?

223
00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:40.770
You need a doctor!

224
00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:43.640
[NAMI] It's nothing,
these cuts are nothing!

225
00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:46.100
[NAMI] No one will find it here.

226
00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.810
I'll save up little by little.

227
00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:53.360
By the time this is filled,
I'll have my hundred million.

228
00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:56.820
[NAMI] Still a long way to go.

229
00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:03.290
[NAMI] 100 million berries...

230
00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:09.460
It's taken a while,
but only seven million left...

231
00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:11.750
I can get that with one more job...

232
00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:15.670
Just one more trip and
this will finally be over.

233
00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:18.720
Arlong's rule will be over...

234
00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.890
Cocoyashi Village will be free...

235
00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:25.560
I will be free... and then...

236
00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:31.650
And then I think I'll finally
be able to smile again for real.

237
00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:33.270
Bellemere...

238
00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:53.290
[GENZO] So why do the Marines want Nami?

239
00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:56.630
[NEZUMI] Your job
is to lead the way, quietly.

240
00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:00.880
A hat pinwheel...

241
00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:03.180
Where in the world did he get that?

242
00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:05.260
It's so cool.

243
00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:15.320
One more little job... Let's get to it.

244
00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:23.200
[NAMI thinking]
Genzo...? And the Marines?

245
00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:30.410
Are you the pirate thief known as Nami?

246
00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:33.830
The Marines' sources have revealed...

247
00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:37.840
that you have quite a large sum of treasure
that you've stolen from pirates...

248
00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:40.670
The government hereby
confiscates everything you've stolen...

249
00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:43.720
It is required that
you comply immediately.

250
00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:47.740
I'm only going to warn you once...

251
00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:50.060
I'm one of the leaders
of the Arlong Pirates...

252
00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:53.150
If you mess with me,
Arlong won't sit by quietly.

253
00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:56.820
Chichichi... Silly girl...
Who do you think I am?

254
00:13:56.820 --> 00:13:59.650
Do you honestly think
you can intimidate me...?

255
00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:01.200
Find the stolen goods!

256
00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.110
Don't move.

257
00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:12.120
I said stop!

258
00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:18.300
Do you really think this is

259
00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:20.210
what the Marines should be doing now?

260
00:14:20.220 --> 00:14:22.010
The Arlong Pirates are murderers;

261
00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:25.050
they've destroyed entire cities
and you're doing nothing!

262
00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:29.260
He's ruling over this island and
trampling over people's lives!

263
00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:33.560
You'd ignore Arlong's atrocities
to steal from a thief...?

264
00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:34.600
Is that what you stand for?!

265
00:14:34.610 --> 00:14:38.360
Chichichi... Big talk
from a filthy criminal...

266
00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:39.940
Ha... Continue the search, men.

267
00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:41.900
Every person on this
island has been waiting

268
00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:44.850
for the Marines to come
and help them for years!

269
00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:48.310
How dare you pass them by and
come here searching for money!

270
00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:49.410
[MARINE C] Colonel...!

271
00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:51.110
This tangerine orchard
seems a little suspicious!

272
00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:52.370
[NEZUMI] Dig it up!

273
00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:54.250
The whole thing if need be!

274
00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:56.420
Keep your filthy hands

275
00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:59.500
off Bellemere's tangerine orchard!

276
00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:04.220
I won't let you take my money...!

277
00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:06.470
That money's for... It's for...!

278
00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:12.490
That poor girl's money is meant
to save Cocoyashi Village...!

279
00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:16.190
What gives you the right to take
our salvation away from her?!

280
00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:16.940
Damn you!

281
00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:20.070
My, my...

282
00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:23.150
A mere village representative
talking down to a Marine colonel.

283
00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:26.280
How bold.

284
00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:28.240
How'd you know about that?

285
00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.240
Genzo...

286
00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:34.080
I've always known... Nami.

287
00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:39.290
[GENZO] I couldn't believe
what you had done...

288
00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:41.840
So I confronted Nojiko about it later.

289
00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:44.260
Since then, everyone
has known that you stayed

290
00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:48.970
with the Arlong Pirates so
that you could save the village.

291
00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:52.060
But we all agreed we'd
never tell you that we knew...

292
00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:55.210
If you ever thought the villagers
were placing their hopes on you,

293
00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:58.270
you might never leave his gang
for fear of letting us down.

294
00:15:59.010 --> 00:16:00.520
That can't be...

295
00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:05.900
Now hold on a minute, just what
are you trying to say here?

296
00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:08.320
Are you telling me that the
villagers are thieves,

297
00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:10.320
and we should arrest
every one of them...?

298
00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:11.700
Is that what you're saying?

299
00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:16.290
[NOJIKO] What he's saying is that every
last one of us is fighting to survive.

300
00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:18.000
[NOJIKO] We have to fend for ourselves

301
00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:20.870
because we can't rely on support
from you government people!

302
00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:24.710
So if you're not gonna protect our
village, then get the hell outta here!

303
00:16:25.140 --> 00:16:28.590
And be quick about it,
or Arlong'll sink your ship too!

304
00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:32.300
Arlong will...? I wouldn't be so sure.

305
00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:36.180
You still haven't found it...?!

306
00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:40.850
We're looking for 100 million
berries here, not a grain of rice!

307
00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:42.290
[GENZO] Hey, you!

308
00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:43.940
How do you know how much there is?!

309
00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:47.950
Oh... I don't know...

310
00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:51.320
I just have a hunch that that's
the amount we're looking for.

311
00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:03.420
It's him...

312
00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:09.010
[ARLONG laughs]

313
00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:10.260
Tell me...!

314
00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:12.010
It was Arlong that sent you, wasn't it?!

315
00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:14.970
Chichichi... 'Course not...

316
00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:17.610
I wouldn't do a pirate's
dirty work, that'd be wrong...

317
00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:22.180
I'm just a public servant dealing with
theft the way any government worker would.

318
00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:23.980
You corrupt Marine scumbag!

319
00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:28.070
The Marines have stooped to being
nothing but pirate cronies!

320
00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:31.110
[NAMI thinking] Arlong!

321
00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:32.490
[MARINE G] Sir, I found it!

322
00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:41.250
Hahaha!

323
00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:42.450
[NEZUMI] Incredible!

324
00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:45.960
I must say I'm impressed you
gathered this much treasure!

325
00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:48.260
The money's all ragged and bloody.

326
00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.420
No matter... Money's money!

327
00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:53.890
Chichichichi...

328
00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:56.350
[thinking] Thirty percent
of this is all mine!

329
00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.770
[NAMI] Don't touch that...

330
00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:02.600
Don't touch that... Don't touch that...

331
00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:04.350
Nami...

332
00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.940
Stop it... Don't touch that!

333
00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:08.570
Stop it!

334
00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:25.630
[NOJIKO] Nami!

335
00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:33.970
Nojiko! Nojiko!

336
00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:41.810
[GENZO] Doctor! Doctor!

337
00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.270
[DOCTOR] Genzo! What is it?!

338
00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:45.600
[GENZO] Nojiko's been shot!

339
00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:46.300
[DOCTOR] By who?!

340
00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:48.100
[GENZO] The Marines.

341
00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.270
[DOCTOR] The Marines?!

342
00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:56.160
Nami.

343
00:18:56.260 --> 00:19:00.240
Hey, Nami...! What's up?!
Need help with anything?!

344
00:19:02.730 --> 00:19:04.000
Why are you still here?

345
00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:06.250
Stay outta my business...!

346
00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:08.750
Just get away from our island!

347
00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:16.860
[NAMI thinking]
Arlong...

348
00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:18.390
I bet it's the village...

349
00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:20.140
You want it left alone?

350
00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:24.790
Gather up 100 million berries,
then bring it to me...

351
00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:28.590
Do so and I will let your village go
in addition to giving you your freedom.

352
00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:30.270
Arlong!

353
00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:31.540
And I'm the kind of fishman

354
00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:34.990
who would rather die than break
an agreement concerning money.

355
00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:38.780
I don't even care how long it takes
you, I will honor our agreement.

356
00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:41.240
Arlong!

357
00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:47.040
What's her problem?

358
00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:50.340
[NAMI] Arlong!

359
00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:51.240
[GROUP] Hmm?

360
00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:52.340
[ARLONG] Hmm?

361
00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:53.420
Ah...

362
00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:58.010
What seems to be the problem,
O skilled surveyor of ours?

363
00:19:58.070 --> 00:20:00.260
Why the sour face?

364
00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:04.770
Those Marine maggots you keep
on the payroll stole every last berry I had!

365
00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:07.420
What happened to all
that crap about dying

366
00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:11.130
before you'd ever break a promise
when it comes to money...?! Bastard!

367
00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:12.300
Refresh my memory.

368
00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:13.480
Did I break a promise?

369
00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:14.630
Don't play dumb with me!

370
00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:17.110
I know that you teamed up
with the Marines to...!

371
00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:20.730
Just when did I break that promise...?

372
00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:22.660
Speak up, girl.

373
00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:28.080
Hahahaha!

374
00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:31.750
[laughter]

375
00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:34.250
[NAMI thinking] Damn you...
Damn you! Damn you!

376
00:20:36.340 --> 00:20:39.180
Too bad... All your
stolen money got stolen...

377
00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:41.720
That certainly is unfortunate...

378
00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:43.650
But a deal is a deal, Nami...

379
00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:47.920
If you can't come up with 100 million berries,
then both you and your village stay

380
00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:49.420
in my possession indefinitely.

381
00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:51.230
Well, you know the terms. Hmm?

382
00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:53.600
You pig!

383
00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:56.360
Hahahaha!

384
00:20:56.370 --> 00:20:58.600
It's only 100 million berries!

385
00:20:58.600 --> 00:21:01.010
Start saving again and
you'll have it in no time!

386
00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:04.060
Hahahaha!

387
00:21:04.060 --> 00:21:07.500
Or are you gonna run out on me?

388
00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:10.080
Listen...

389
00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:12.580
If you do that, I'll kill
everyone in that village.

390
00:21:12.590 --> 00:21:13.920
Do you understand me?

391
00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:18.830
[GENZO] Nami...

392
00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:21.680
We agreed we would never
tell you that we knew...

393
00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:25.720
If you thought all of us were counting
on you, you would be bound by guilt

394
00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:28.730
never to leave his gang
for fear of letting us down.

395
00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:36.440
Aww... Running away so soon?

396
00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:39.740
Hahahaha!

397
00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:41.700
Shouldn't we chase after her?

398
00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:44.160
[ARLONG] No need for that.

399
00:21:44.180 --> 00:21:46.830
Trust me, Hachi, she's
not going anywhere...

400
00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:51.330
There's no way Nami could just abandon
the lives of all those villagers.

401
00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:55.210
[CHOO] Choo. Now that's
what I call playing dirty.

402
00:21:55.220 --> 00:21:59.420
There's no way I'd let go of
an asset like Nami that easily.

403
00:21:59.930 --> 00:22:02.680
I may be cruel but
I'm not totally heartless.

404
00:22:04.330 --> 00:22:09.270
Once she's done charting all the world's
oceans, she'll have her freedom.

405
00:22:09.100 --> 00:22:11.230
[laughter]

406
00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.370
That's pretty harsh, man,
it'll take decades for sure.

407
00:22:15.370 --> 00:22:18.190
Yeah, I bet a hundred
years wouldn't be enough!

408
00:22:27.260 --> 00:22:28.740
We've had enough...! Take up arms!

409
00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:29.830
It's time to fight!

410
00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:35.960
[NAMI thinking]
Genzo! Please!

411
00:22:35.970 --> 00:22:38.750
Don't do anything stupid!

412
00:22:38.800 --> 00:22:42.800
We have to live or our
struggles will mean nothing!

413
00:22:42.810 --> 00:22:45.140
You can't throw your lives away!

414
00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:47.510
[GENZO] Eight long years ago...

415
00:22:47.710 --> 00:22:50.680
We promised we wouldn't
live our lives in vain!

416
00:22:50.880 --> 00:22:52.810
No matter the pain or humiliation

417
00:22:52.810 --> 00:22:56.770
we endured under Arlong, we
swore to fight the long fight

418
00:22:56.780 --> 00:22:58.650
so Nami could meet their demands!

419
00:22:58.810 --> 00:23:00.400
But, they lied!

420
00:23:00.410 --> 00:23:03.190
They never intended to
keep their end of the deal.

421
00:23:03.210 --> 00:23:06.320
Instead they stole our
only chance at freedom!

422
00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:07.240
So now...

423
00:23:07.420 --> 00:23:09.620
We should make those filthy fishmen pay

424
00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:12.200
for the years they manipulated
that kind young girl...!

425
00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:13.000
Am I right?!

426
00:23:13.430 --> 00:23:14.870
[VILLAGER E] Yeah! Let's do this!

427
00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:17.770
[VILLAGER H] We were always ready
to fight those monsters!

428
00:23:17.770 --> 00:23:19.040
Let's get 'em!

429
00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:22.170
Time to show those lousy stinkin'
fishmen what we're made of!

430
00:23:23.010 --> 00:23:24.180
Yeah!

431
00:23:24.180 --> 00:23:26.180
[NAMI] Everybody! Wait!

432
00:23:26.180 --> 00:23:27.760
Huh?

433
00:23:28.020 --> 00:23:29.050
[NOJIKO] Nami!

434
00:23:29.270 --> 00:23:32.350
Hahaha.

435
00:23:32.610 --> 00:23:33.710
Calm down...!

436
00:23:33.710 --> 00:23:35.480
It's not that much money...!

437
00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:37.410
I can make it back in no time...!

438
00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:40.100
I'll take care of it, don't worry!

439
00:23:40.100 --> 00:23:43.110
It'll be easy... this time!
I'm used to it!

440
00:23:43.240 --> 00:23:46.150
I'll be fine! Just relax!
Everything is okay!

441
00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:50.280
Hey... It's nothing
compared to back then.

442
00:23:51.720 --> 00:23:54.750
It's okay...!
You don't need to save me!

443
00:23:54.760 --> 00:23:56.360
C'mon, everyone!

444
00:23:56.360 --> 00:23:58.040
I'm perfectly fine!

445
00:24:04.140 --> 00:24:05.100
You've done enough...

446
00:24:05.100 --> 00:24:07.680
You have to know
that there is no point now.

447
00:24:08.770 --> 00:24:13.010
You struggled so hard, carrying our
lives on your back this whole time.

448
00:24:13.180 --> 00:24:16.390
I can only imagine that joining
them must have been more painful,

449
00:24:16.450 --> 00:24:18.980
than being stabbed through the heart.

450
00:24:20.250 --> 00:24:22.360
[GENZO] You fought very well.

451
00:24:24.220 --> 00:24:25.150
[NAMI] Genzo...

452
00:24:31.140 --> 00:24:33.410
Set yourself free from this village.

453
00:24:35.020 --> 00:24:35.830
[NAMI] Genzo!

454
00:24:37.020 --> 00:24:38.330
[NOJIKO] Nami. Do it.

455
00:24:38.650 --> 00:24:39.710
[NAMI] What?! Nojiko!

456
00:24:40.710 --> 00:24:41.460
Nami...

457
00:24:41.580 --> 00:24:42.540
Go on.

458
00:24:43.880 --> 00:24:45.630
You are an exceptional young woman...

459
00:24:45.650 --> 00:24:46.920
And you have a dream.

460
00:24:47.210 --> 00:24:48.680
Everyone! Listen!

461
00:24:49.680 --> 00:24:51.510
I won't let you go...!

462
00:24:52.320 --> 00:24:53.520
Just stay right there...!

463
00:24:53.520 --> 00:24:57.060
I'm not going to let anyone
else get hurt by these monsters!

464
00:24:59.860 --> 00:25:00.810
You'll all die...

465
00:25:01.860 --> 00:25:03.150
We know that.

466
00:25:09.290 --> 00:25:12.320
Nami... It's no use,
we've made up our minds!

467
00:25:16.160 --> 00:25:17.620
Get outta the way!

468
00:25:19.910 --> 00:25:21.170
[GENZO] Move out!

469
00:25:22.300 --> 00:25:24.460
[DOCTOR] We may not win
but we will give 'em hell!

470
00:25:25.000 --> 00:25:31.010
[cheers]

471
00:25:34.510 --> 00:25:41.600
[NAMI sobs]

472
00:25:51.740 --> 00:25:54.410
[ARLONG laughs]

473
00:26:03.290 --> 00:26:05.290
Arlong!

474
00:26:06.800 --> 00:26:11.170
Arlong! Arlong! Arlong! Arlong!

475
00:26:11.170 --> 00:26:12.340
Arlong!

476
00:26:12.340 --> 00:26:14.970
Arlong! Arlong!

477
00:26:14.970 --> 00:26:16.810
Arl–!

478
00:26:21.310 --> 00:26:22.440
Luffy.

479
00:26:26.590 --> 00:26:27.650
[NAMI] What do you want?

480
00:26:27.930 --> 00:26:29.780
You don't know anything about this.

481
00:26:29.960 --> 00:26:33.570
You don't know what's been happening
on this island for the past eight years.

482
00:26:33.600 --> 00:26:35.320
[LUFFY] Nope. I don't.

483
00:26:36.040 --> 00:26:37.700
This has nothing to do with you!

484
00:26:38.920 --> 00:26:41.160
I told you to leave this place.

485
00:26:41.370 --> 00:26:42.960
Yep... You sure did.

486
00:26:42.970 --> 00:26:45.790
[NAMI] So leave...!
I told you to leave...!

487
00:26:46.340 --> 00:26:49.310
Get out of here...!
Get out of here now...!

488
00:26:49.310 --> 00:26:54.430
Go...! Go away...! Go...! Go...! Go!

489
00:27:08.820 --> 00:27:10.480
[NAMI] Luffy...

490
00:27:10.480 --> 00:27:11.860
Help me...

491
00:27:17.610 --> 00:27:22.040
[LUFFY] Of course...
That's what friends do.

492
00:27:24.050 --> 00:27:26.670
He's gonna pay!

493
00:27:29.390 --> 00:27:31.710
You better keep your hands off my hat.

494
00:27:33.960 --> 00:27:35.220
[NAMI] Luffy.

495
00:27:41.220 --> 00:27:42.810
Let's go!

496
00:27:43.780 --> 00:27:46.190
Right!

497
00:27:49.980 --> 00:27:52.350
[VILLAGER A] Hey!
Are you guys all right?

498
00:27:52.350 --> 00:27:54.320
[DOCTOR] Did Arlong do this to you?

499
00:27:55.690 --> 00:27:57.070
[GENZO] Move aside!

500
00:27:58.220 --> 00:28:00.580
We have business to take
care of with the fishmen.

501
00:28:01.320 --> 00:28:04.080
When we finally found out
the truth about Big Sis Nami...

502
00:28:04.090 --> 00:28:07.540
We realized the only thing we could
do was defeat Arlong in battle...

503
00:28:07.550 --> 00:28:10.340
So we decided to come back
here and challenge him.

504
00:28:10.410 --> 00:28:12.960
Yeah... Then we lost,
but only by a hair.

505
00:28:14.920 --> 00:28:17.300
I'm sorry, but I can't
let you through this door...

506
00:28:17.320 --> 00:28:19.050
You have no chance of victory.

507
00:28:19.420 --> 00:28:20.260
What's that?

508
00:28:20.260 --> 00:28:21.140
Be patient...

509
00:28:21.160 --> 00:28:22.310
It won't be long now.

510
